{
  "title": "Dua-e-Iftetaah",
  "code": "012",
  "data": "بِسْمِ اللهِ الرَّحْمٰنِ الرَّحِيْمِ\nBISMIL LAAHIR RAHMAANIR RAHEEM\nIn the name of Allah, the Beneficent, the Merciful.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اِنِّىْ اَفْتَتِحُ الثَّنَآءَ بِحَمْدِكَ\nALLAAHUMMA INNEE AFTATEHUS SANAA-A BE-HAMDEKA \nO Allah! I begin the Glorification with Thy Praise\nوَ اَنْتَ مُسَدِّدٌ لِلصَّوَابِ بِمَنِّكَ\nWA ANTA MOSADDEDUN LIS-SAWAABE BE-MANNEKA \nWhile You grant freely of the portion (bounties) because of Your obligation (on me)\nوَ اَيْقَنْتُ اَنَّكَ اَنْتَ اَرْحَمُ الرَّاحِمِيْنَ فِىْ مَوْضِعِ الْعَفْوِ وَ الرَّحْمَةِ\nWA AYQANTO ANNAKA ANTA ARHAMUR RAAHEMEENA FEE MAWZE-I’L A’FWE WAR-RAHMATE \nAnd I am certain that You are the Most Merciful in regard with forgiveness and mercy.\nوَ اَشَدُّ الْمُعَاقِبِيْنَ فِى مَوْضِعِ النَّكَالِ وَالنَّقِمَةِ\nWA ASHADDUL MO-A’AQEBEENA FEE MAW-ZE-I’N NAKAALE WAN-NAQEMATE \nAnd the most severe in regard with exemplary punishment and chastisement to wrong doers.\nوَ اَعْظَمُ الْمُتَجَبِّرِيْنَ فِىْ مَوْضِعِ الْكِبْرِيَآءِ وَ الْعَظَمَةِ\nWA A-A’ZAMUL MOTAJABBEREENA FEE MAW-ZE-I’L KIBREYAA-E WAL-A’ZAMATE. \nAnd the Omnipotent in the domain of absolute power and might. \nاَللّٰهُمَّ اَذِنْتَ لِىْ فِىْ دُعَائِكَ وَ مَسْئَلَتِكَ\nALLAAHUMMA AZINTA LEE FEE DO-A’A-EKA WA MAS-ALATEKA \nO Allah, You have permitted me to invoke Thee and beg Thee, \nفَاسْمَعْ يَا سَمِيْعُ مِدْحَتِىْ\nFASMA’ YAA SAMEE-O’ MIDHATEE \nthen do listen my praise, O the Hearer, \nوَ اَجِبْ يَا رَحِيْمُ دَعْوَتِىْ\nWA AJIB YAA RAHEEMO DA’WATEE \nand answer my prayer, O Merciful. \nوَ اَقِلْ يَا غَفُوْرُ عَثْرَتِىْ\nWA AQIL YAA GHAFOORO A’SRATEE \nAnd reduce my lapses, O the All Forgiving.\nفَكَمْ يَا اِلٰهِىْ مِنْ كُرْبَةٍ قَدْ فَرَّجْتَهَا\nFA-KAM YAA ELAAHEE MIN KURBATIN QAD FARRAJTAHAA\nO Allah! There are so many trouble which You have removed,\nوَ هُمُوْمٍ قَدْ كَشَفْتَهَا\nWA HOMOOMIN QAD KASHAFTAHAA \nand sorrows which You have dispelled, \nوَ عَثْرَةٍ قَدْ اَقَلْتَهَا\nWA A’SRATIN QAD AQALTAHAA \nand mistakes that You have reduced,\nوَ رَحْمَةٍ قَدْ نَشَرْتَهَا\nWA RAHMATIN QAD NASHARTAHAA \nand mercy that You have spread,\nوَ حَلْقَةِ بَلَآءٍ قَدْ فَكَكْتَهَا\nWA HALQATE BALAA-IN QAD FAKAKTAHAA \nand circles of calamities which You have cleared.\nاَلْحَمْدُ لِلّٰهِ الَّذِىْ لَمْ يَتَّخِذْ صَاحِبَةً وَّ لَا وَلَدًا\nALHAMDO LIL-LLAAHIL LAZEE LAM YATTAKHIZ SAAHEBATAN WA LAA WALADAN \nAll Praise be to Allah (alone) who did not take a mate nor a son \nوَ لَمْ يَكُنْ لَهٗ شَرِيْكٌ فِى الْمُلْكِ\nWA LAM YAKUN LAHU SHAREEKUN FIL MULKE \nWho has no partner in His Kingdom,\nوَ لَمْ يَكُنْ لَهٗ وَلِىٌّ مِنَ الذُّلِّ وَ كَبِّرْهُ تَكْبِيْرًا\nWA LAM YAKUN LAHU WALIYYUN MENAZ ZULLE WA KABBIRHO TAKBEERAN \nnor does He have master in dependence, Then Magnify Him as He should be magnified.\nاَلْحَمْدُ لِلّٰهِ بِجَمِيْعِ مَحَامِدِهٖ كُلِّهَا\nALHAMDO LILLAAHE BE-JAMEE-E’ MAHAAMEDEHI KULLEHAA \nAll Praise is for Allah with All Praises \nعَلٰى جَمِيْعِ نِعَمِهٖ كُلِّهَا\nA’LAA JAMEE-E’ NE-A’MEHI KULLEHAA \nfor all His bounties.\nاَلْحَمْدُ لِلّٰهِ الَّذِىْ لَا مُضَّآدَّ لَهٗ فِىْ مُلْكِهٖ\nALHAMDO LILLAAHIL LAZEE LAA MOZAAD-DA LAHU FEE MULKEHI \nAll Praise is for Allah who does not have any opposition in His Kingdom\nوَ لَا مُنَازِعَ لَهٗ فِىْ اَمْرِهٖ\nWA LAA MONAA-ZE-A’ LAHU FEE AMREHI \nnor any dispute in His commands. \nاَلْحَمْدُ لِلّٰهِ الَّذِىْ لَا شَرِيْكَ لَهٗ فِىْ خَلْقِهٖ\nALHAMDO LILLAAHIL LAZEE LAA SHAREEKA LAHU FEE KHALQEHI \nAll Praise is for Allah who does not have a partner in His creation \nوَ لَا شَبِيْهَ لَهٗ فِىْ عَظَمَتِهٖ\nWA LAA SHA-BEHA LAHU FEE A’ZAMATEHI \nnor is there anything similar unto Him in His greatness. \nاَلْحَمْدُ لِلّٰهِ الْفَاشِىْ فِى الْخَلْقِ\nALHAMDO LILLAAHIL FAASHEE FIL KHALQE \nAll Praise is for Allah the evident in His command \nاَمْرُهٗ وَ حَمْدُهٗ الظَّاهِرِ بِالْكَرَمِ مَجْدُهٗ الْبَاسِطِ بِالْجُوْدِ\nAMROHU WA HAMDOHUZ ZAAHERE BIL-KARAME MAJDOHUL BAASETE BIL-JOODE \nand His praise is apparent, His glory is through Honour,\nيَدَهُ الَّذِىْ لَا تَنْقُصُ خَزَآئِنُهٗ\nYADAHUL LAZEE LAA TANQOSO KHAZAA-ENOHU \nHis hands open with generosity, which does not decreases His treasure\nوَ لَا تَزِيْدُهٗ كَثْرَةُ الْعَطَآءِ اِلَّا جُوْدًا وَ كَرَمًا\nWA LAA TAZEEDOHU KASRATUL A’TAA-E ILLAA JOODAN WA KARAMAN \nand His excess bestowals does not increases anything except with generosity and honour,\nاِنَّهٗ هُوَ الْعَزِيْزُ الْوَهَّابُ\nINNAHU HOWAL A’ZEEZUL WAHHAABO. \nSurely He is the Mighty, the excessive Provider.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اِنِّىْ اَسْئَلُكَ قَلِيْلًا مِنْ كَثِيْرٍ\nALLAAHUMMA INNEE AS-ALOKA QALEELAN MIN KASEERIN \nO Allah I ask You some of my many needs \nمَعَ حَاجَةٍ بِىْ اِلَيْهِ عَظِيْمَةٍ\nMA-A’ HAAJATIN BEE ELAYHE A’ZEEMATIN \nupon which I greatly depend \nوَ غِنَاكَ عَنْهُ قَدِيْمٌ\nWA GHENAAKA A’NHO QADEEMUN \nwhile You are needless of them since eternity,\nوَ هُوَ عِنْدِىْ كَثِيْرٌ\nWA HOWA I’NDEE KASEERUN \nthey are a lot for me, \nوَ هُوَ عَلَيْكَ سَهْلٌ يَسِيْرٌ\nWA HOWA A’LAYKA SAHLUN YASEERUN.\nbut for You it is very easy and simple.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اِنَّ عَفْوَكَ عَنْ ذَنْبِىْ\nALLAAHUMMA INNA A’FWAKA A’N ZAMBEE \nO Allah, surely Your forgiveness of my sins, \nوَ تَجَاوُزَكَ عَنْ خَطِيْئَتِىْ\nWA TAJAA-WAZAKA A’N KHATEE-ATEE \nYour overlooking of my mistakes,\nوَ صَفْحَكَ عَنْ ظُلْمِىْ\nWA SAFHAKA A’N ZULMEE \nYour forgiveness of my injustices (unto me) \nوَ سِتْرَكَ عَلٰى قَبِيْحِ عَمَلِىْ\nWA SITRAKA A’N QABEEHE A’MALEE \nYour concealment of my evil deeds,\nوَ حِلْمَكَ عَنْ كَثِيْرِ جُرْمِىْ\nWA HILMAKA A’N KASEERE JURMEE \nYour forbearance on the extremity of my crimes which were committed\nعِنْدَ مَا كَانَ مِنْ خَطَئِیْ وَ عَمْدِىْ\nI’NDA MAA KAANA MIN KHA-TA-EE WA A’MADEE \neither due to negligence or wilfuly. \nاَطْمَعَنِىْ فِىْ اَنْ اَسْئَلُكَ مَا لَا اَسْتَوْجِبُهٗ مِنْكَ\nAT-MA-A’NEE FEE AN AS-ALAKA MAA LAA ASTAWJEBOHU MINKAL \nProvide me hope to ask from You of that which I am not worthy of. \nالَّذِىْ رَزَقْتَنِىْ مِنْ رَحْمَتِكَ\nLAZEE RAZAQTANEE MIN RAHMATEKA \nYou have sustained me due to Your mercy \nوَ اَرَيْتَنِىْ مِنْ قُدْرَتِكَ\nWA ARAYTANEE MIN QUDRATEKA \nAnd shown me of Your Power \nوَعَرَّفْتَنِيْ مِنْ اِجَابَتِكَ \nWA A’RRAFTANEE MIN EJAABATEKA \nand introduced me by Your response (to my prayers). \nفَصِرْتُ اَدْعُوْكَ اٰمِنًا\nFA-SIRTO AD-O’OKA AAMENAN \nThen I have come calling You, believing in You, \nوَ اَسْئَلُكَ مُسْتَانِسًا لَا خَائِفًا وَ لَا وَجِلًا\nWA AS-ALOKA MUSTAA-NESAN LAA KHAA-EFAN WA LAA WAJELAN \nand I ask You as a close acquaintance, neither fearful nor afraid, \nمُدِلًا عَلَيْكَ فِيْمَا قَصَدْتُ فِيْهِ اِلَيْكَ\nMODILLAN A’LAYKA FEEMAA QASADTO FEEHE ELAYKA \nhaving faith upon You whenever I turn to You concerning it. \nفَاِنْ اَبْطَا عَنِّىْ عَتَبْتُ بِجَهْلِىْ عَلَيْكَ\nFA-IN AB-TA-A A’NNEE A’TABTO BE-JAHLEE A’LAYKA \nI blame my ignorance about You for this delay. \nوَ لَعَلَّ الَّذِىْ اَبْطَا عَنِّىْ هُوَ خَيْرٌ لِىْ\nWA LA-A’LLAL LAZEE AB-TA-A A’NNEE HOWA KHAYRUN LEE \nAnd perhaps whatever is delayed in my matter is better for me, \nلِعِلْمِكَ بِعَاقِبَةِ الْاُمُوْرِ\nLE-I’LMEKA BE-A’AQEBATIL OMOORE \nfor You know about the consequences of the affairs. \nفَلَمْ اَرَ مَوْلًى كَرِيْمًا\nFALAM ARA MAWLAN KAREEMAN \nThen I did not see an Honourable Master \nاَصْبَرَ عَلٰى عَبْدٍ لَئِيْمٍ مِنْكَ عَلَىَّ\nASBARA A’LAA A’BDIN LA-EEMIN MINKA A’LAYYA \nmore patient to His disgraceful servant than You are to me. \nيَا رَبِّ اِنَّكَ تَدْعُوْنِىْ فَاُوَلِّىْ عَنْكَ\nYAA RABBE INNA TAD-O’ONEE FA-OWALLEE A’NKA \nO Lord! You call me but I turn away from You, \nوَ تَتَحَبَّبُ اِلَىَّ فَاَتَبَغَّضُ اِلَيْكَ\nWA TATAHABBABO ELAYYA FA-ATABAGH-GHAZO ELAYKA \nYou care to love me but I am bent upon hating You. \nوَ تَتَوَدَّدُ اِلَىَّ فَلَا اَقْبَلُ مِنْكَ\nWA TA-TA-WADDADO ELAYYA FALAA AQBALO MINKA \nYou want to show Your affections for me but I do not accept it from You \nكَاَنَّ لِىَ التَّطَوُّلَ عَلَيْكَ\nKA-ANNA LEYAT TATAWWOLA A’LAYKA \nas if I am obliging You. \nفَلَمْ يَمْنَعْكَ ذٰلِكَ مِنَ الرَّحْمَةِ لِىْ \nFALAM YAMNA’KA ZAALEKA MENAR RAHMATE LEE \nBut this should not prevent You from bestowing (Your) mercy, \nوَ الْاِحْسَانِ اِلَىَّ وَ التَّفَضُّلِ عَلَىَّ بِجُوْدِكَ وَ كَرَمِكَ\nWAL EHSAANE ELAYYA WAT TAFAZZOLE A’LAYYA BEJOODEKA WA KARAMEKA \ngoodness, and grace upon me for the sake of Your generosity and Your Honour. \nفَارْحَمْ عَبْدَكَ الْجَاهِلَ\nFAR-HAM A’BDAKAL JAAHELA \nThen have mercy on Your ignorant servant \nوَ جُدْ عَلَيْهِ بِفَضْلِ اِحْسَانِكَ\nWA JUD A’LAYHE BE-FAZLE EHSAANEKA \nand be generous to him with Your graceful obligations.\nاِنَّكَ جَوَادٌ كَرِيْمٌ\nINNAKA JAWAADUN KAREEMUN.\nCertainly You are Generous, Honourable. \nاَلْحَمْدُ لِلّٰهِ مَالِكَ الْمُلْكِ\nAL-HAMDO LILLAAHE MAALEKIL MULKE \nAll Praise is for Allah, the Owner of the Kingdom, \nمُجْرِىْ الْفُلْكِ مُسَخِّرِ الرِّيَاحِ\nMUJRIL FULKE MOSAKH-KHERIR REYAAHE \nRegulator of skies, Controller of the winds, \nفَالِقِ الْاِصْبَاحِ دَيَّانِ الدِّيْنِ رَبِّ الْعَالَمِيْنَ\nFAALEQIL ISBAAHE DAYYAANID DEENE RABBIL A’ALAMEENA.\nBreaker of dawn, administrator of the authority, Lord of the Universe.\nاَلْحَمْدُ لِلّٰهِ عَلٰى حِلْمِهٖ بَعْدَ عِلْمِهٖ\nALHAMDO LILLAAHE A’LAA HILMEHI BA’DA I’LMEHI \nAll Praise is for Allah due to His forbearance after His Knowledge \nوَ الْحَمْدُ لِلّٰهِ عَلٰى عَفْوِهٖ بَعْدَ قُدْرَتِهٖ\nALHAMDO LILLAAHE A’LAA A’FWEHI BA’DA QUDRATEHI \nand All Praise is for Allah on account of His forgiveness after His Power. \nوَ الْحَمْدُ لِلّٰهِ عَلٰى طُوْلِ اَنَاتِهٖ فِىْ غَضَبِهٖ\nWAL HAMDO LILLAAHE A’LAA TOOLE ANAATEHI FEE GHAZABEHI \nAll Praise is for Allah due to the length of His respite in His anger \nوَ هُوَ قَادِرٌ عَلٰى مَا يُرِيْدُ\nWA HOWA QAADERUN A’LAA MAA YOREEDO. \nwhile He is having power on what He wills.\nاَلْحَمْدُ لِلّٰهِ خَالِقِ الْخَلْقِ\nALHAMDO LILLAAHE KHAALEQIL KHALQE \nAll Praise is for Allah, the Creator of the creatures, \nبَاسِطِ الرِّزْقِ فَالِقِ الْاِصْبَاحِ\nBAASETIR RIZQE FAALEQIL ISBAAHE \nSpreader of the sustenance, Breaker of dawn, \nذِى الْجَلاَلِ وَ الْاِكْرَامِ وَ الْفَضْلِ وَ الْاِنْعَامِ\nZIL JALAALE WAL IKRAAME WAL FAZLE WAL IN-A’AMIL \nthe Owner of the majesty and Honour, favours and bounties, \nالَّذِىْ بَعُدَ فَلَا يُرٰى\nLAZEE BA-O’DA FALAA YORAA \nOne who, when far, is not seen, \nوَ قَرُبَ فَشَهِدَ النَّجْوىٰ\nWA QAROBA FA-SHA-HEDAN NAJWAA \nand when near, then witnesses the whispers, \nتَبَارَكَ وَ تَعَالٰى\nTABAARAKA WA TA-A’ALAA. \nthe Blessed, the High. \nاَلْحَمْدُ لِلّٰهِ الَّذِىْ لَيْسَ لَهٗ مُنَازِعٌ يُعَادِلُهٗ\nALHAMDO LILLAAHIL LAZEE LAYSA LAHU MONAA-ZE-U’N YO-A’ADELOHU \nAll Praise is for Allah for whom there is no dispute who can equal Him \nوَ لَا شَبِيْهٌ يُشٰاكِلُهٗ وَ لَا ظَهِيْرٌ يُعٰاضِدُهٗ\nWA LAA SHA-BEEHUN YOSHAAKELOHU WA LAA ZAHEERUN YO-A’AZEDOHU \nnor any resemblance  who can be similar to Him, nor any helper to assist Him, \nقَهَرَ بِعِزَّتِهِ الْاَعِزَّآءَ\nQAHARA BE-I’ZZATEHIL A-I’ZZAA-A \nHe subdues the powerful ones \nوَ تَوَاضَعَ لِعَظَمَتِهِ الْعُظَمَآءُ\nWA TAWAA-ZA-A’ LE-A’ZAMATEHIL O’ZAMAA-O \nwhile the great ones are humble before His Greatness. \nفَبَلَغَ بِقُدْرَتِهٖ مَا يَشَآءُ\nFA-BALAGHA BE-QUDRATEHI MAA YASHAA-O. \nSo He raises up by His power whatever He wishes. \nاَلْحَمْدُ لِلّٰهِ الَّذِىْ يُجِيْبُنِىْ حِيْنَ اُنَادِيْهِ\nAL-HAMDO LILLAAHIL LAZEE YOJEEBONEE HEENA ONAADEEHE \nAll Praise is for Allah who answers when I call Him, \nوَ يَسْتُرُ عَلَىَّ كُلَّ عَوْرَةٍ وَ اَنَا اَعْصِيْهِ\nWA YASTORO A’LAYYA KULLA A’WRATIN WA ANAA A-A’SEEHE \ncovers up all my defects while I disobey Him, \nوَ يُعَظِّمُ النِّعْمَةَ عَلَىَّ فَلَا اُجَازِيْهِ\nWA YO-A’ZZEMUN NE’MATA A’LAYYA FALAA OJAA-ZEEHE \nconfers great bounties upon me but I do not give Him anything in return. \nفَكَمْ مِنْ مَوْهِبَةٍ هَنِيْئَةٍ قَدْ اَعْطَانِىْ\nFAKAM MIN MAWHEBATIN HANEE-ATIN QAD A-A’TAANEE \nThen how many nice favours He has granted on me, \nوَ عَظِيْمَةٍ مَخُوْفَةٍ قَدْ كَفَانِىْ\nWA A’ZEEMATIN MAKHOOFATIN QAD KAFAANEE \nand great dangers from which He has saved me, \nوَ بَهْجَةٍ مُوْنِقَةٍ قَدْ اَرَانِىْ\nWA BAHJATIN MOONEQATIN QAD ARAANEE \nand happy joys which He has availed to me, \nفَاُثْنِىْ عَلَيْهِ حَامِدًا وَ اَذْكُرُهٗ مُسَبِّحًا\nFA-USNEE A’LAYHE HAAMEDAN WA AZKOROHU MOSABBEHAN. \nthen I praised Him as He should be praised and I remember Him as He should be glorified. \nاَلْحَمْدُ لِلّٰهِ الَّذِىْ لَا يُهْتَكُ حِجَابُهٗ\nALHAMDO LILLAAHIL LAZEE LAA YOHTAKO HEJAABOHU \nAll Praise is for Allah whose veil cannot be torn, \nوَ لَا يُغْلَقُ بَابُهٗ وَ لَا يُرَدُّ سَآئِلُهٗ\nWA LAA YUGHLAQO BAABOHU WA LAA YORADDO SAA-ELOHU \nnor His door locked nor the one who begs from Him be neglected \nوَ لَا يُخَيَّبُ اٰمِلُهٗ\nWA LAA YOKHAYYABO AAMELOHU. \nnor the one who hopes from Him despaired. \nاَلْحَمْدُ لِلّٰهِ الَّذِىْ يُؤْمِنُ الْخَائِفِيْنَ\nALHAMDO LILLAAHIL LAZEE YOA-MENUL KHAA-EFEENA \nAll praise is for Allah who protects the fearful ones \nوَ يُنَجِّى الصَّالِحِيْنَ\nWA YONAJJIS SAALEHEENA \nand saves the righteous,\nوَ يَرْفَعُ الْمُسْتَضْعَفِيْنَ\nWA YAR-FA-U’L MUSTAZ-A’FEENA \nraises the oppressed, \nوَ يَضَعُ الْمُسْتَكْبِرِيْنَ\nWA YAZA-U’L MUSTAKBEREENA \ndegrades the prouds, \nوَ يُهْلِكُ مُلُوْكًا وَ يَسْتَخْلِفُ اٰخَرِيْنَ\nYOHLEKO MOLOOKAN WA YASTAKHLEFO AAKHAREENA\ndestroys the Kings and appoints other (in their place). \nوَ الْحَمْدُ لِلّٰهِ قَاصِمِ الْجَبَّارِيْنَ مُبِيْرِ الظّٰالِمِيْنَ\nWAL HAMDO LILLAAHE QAASEMIL JABBAAREENA MOBEERIZ ZAALEMEENA \nAll Prase is for Allah, the Breaker of the tyrants, the Destroyer of oppressors, \nمُدْرِكِ الْهَارِبِيْنَ نَكَالِ الظَّالِمِيْنَ\nMUDREKIL HAAREBEENA NAKAALIZ ZAALEMEENA \nthe Observer of fugitives, Chastiser of the unjust, \nصَرِيْخِ الْمُسْتَصْرِخِيْنَ \nSAREEKHIL MUSTASREKHEENA \nthe Helper of the crying ones, \nمَوْضِعِ حَاجَاتِ الطَّالِبِيْنَ\nMAW-ZE-A’ HAAJAATIT TAALEBEENA \nthe Centre of the demands of beseechers, \nمُعْتَمَدِ الْمُوْمِنِيْنَ\nMO’TAMADIL MOA-MENEENA. \nthe Confidence of the believers. \nاَلْحَمْدُ لِلّٰهِ الَّذِىْ مِنْ خَشْيَتِهٖ تَرْعَدُ السَّمَآءُ وَ سُكَّانُهَا\nALHAMDO LILLAAHIL LAZEE MIN KHASYATEHI TAR-A’DUS SAMAA-O WA SUKKAANOHAA \nAll Praise is for Allah with Whose fear the heavens and its inhabitants shiver \nوَ تَرْجُفُ الْاَرضُ وَ عُمَّارُهَا\nWA TARJOFUL ARZO WA U’MMAAROHAA \nand the earth and its dwellers tremble, \nوَ تَمُوْجُ الْبِحَارُ وَ مَنْ يَسْبَحُ فِىْ غَمَرَاتِهَا\nWA TAMOOJUL BEHAARO WA MAN YASBAHO FEE GHAMARAATEHAA. \nthe oceans and whatever float in its depths overflows (with awe). \nاَلْحَمْدُ لِلّٰهِ الَّذِىْ هَدَانَا لِهٰذَا\nALHAMDO LILLAAHIL LAZEE HADAANAA LE-HAAZAA \nAll Praise is for Allah Who guided us to this (path). \nوَ مَا كُنَّا لِنَهْتَدِىَ لَوْلَا اَنْ هَدَانَا اللهُ\nWA MAA KUNNA LE-NAHTADEYA LAW LAA AN HADAANAL LAAHO. \nAnd we could not have been guided had Allah not guided us. \nاَلْحَمْدُ لِلّٰهِ الَّذِى يَخْلُقُ وَ لَمْ يُخْلَقُ\nALHAMDO LILLAAHIL LAZEE YAKHLOQO WA LAM YUKHLAQ \nAll Praise is for Allah, the One Who creates but is not created, \nوَ يَرْزُقُ وَ لَا يُرْزَقُ وَ يُطْعِمُ وَ لَا يُطْعَمُ\nWA YARZOQO WA LAA YURZAQO WA YUT-E’MO WA LAA YUT-A’MO \nHe sustains but is not sustained, He feeds but is not fed, \nوَ يُمِيْتُ الْاَحْيَآءَ وَ يُحْيِىْ الْمَوْتٰى وَ هُوَ حَىٌّ لَا يَمُوْتُ\nWA YOMEETUL AHYAAHO WA YOHYIL MAWTAA WA HOWA HAYYUN LAA YAMOOTO \nHe causes death to the living and gives life to the dead. He is the Living Who shall never die.\nبِيَدِهِ الْخَيْرُ وَ هُوَ عَلٰى كُلِّ شَىْءٍ قَدِيْرٌ\nBE-YADEHIL KHAYRO WA HOWA A’LAA KULLE SHAY-IN QADEERUN. \nIn His hands is all the goodness, and He has Power over all things.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ صَلِّ عَلٰى مُحَمَّدٍ\nALLAAHUMMA SALLE A’LAA MOHAMMADIN \nO Allah send Your blessings on Mohammad \nعَبْدِكَ وَ رَسُوْلِكَ وَ اَمِيْنِكَ وَ صَفِيِّكَ \nA’BDEKA WA RASOOLEKA WA AMEENEKA WA SAFIYYEKA \nYour servant, Your messenger, Your trustworthy and Your selected, \nوَ حَبِيْبِكَ وَ خِيَرَتِكَ مِنْ خَلْقِكَ \nWA HABEEBEKA WA KHEYARATEKA MIN KHALQEKA \nYour beloved, Your chosen one from Your creatures, \nوَ حَافِظِ سِرِّكَ وَ مُبَلِّغِ رِسَالاَتِكَ\nWA HAAFEZE SIRREKA WA MOBALLEGHE RESAALAATEKA\nthe protector of Your secrets, the conveyor of Your message,\nاَفْضَلَ وَ اَحْسَنَ وَ اَجْمَلَ وَاَكْمَلَ وَاَزْكٰى وَ اَنْمٰى\nAFZALA WA AHSANA WA AJMALA WA AKMALA WA AZKAA WA ANMAA \nthe most superior, the best, the most handsome, the most perfect, the most purified, the evergrowing,\nوَ اَطْيَبَ وَ اَطْهَرَ وَاَسْنٰى وَ اَكْثَرَ مَا صَلَّيْتَ وَ بَارَكْتَ وَ تَرَحَّمْتَ\nWA ATYABA WA ATHARA WA ASNAA WA AKSARA MAA SALLAYTA WA BAARAKTA WA TARAH-HAMTA \nthe most sublime, the most purified, the noblest and the maximum of blessing the like of which You have not blessed,\nوَ تَحَنَّنْتَ وَ سَلَّمْتَ عَلٰى اَحَدٍ مِنْ عِبَادِكَ\nWA TAHANNANTA WA SALLAMTA A’LAA AHADIN MIN E’BAADEKA \nYou blessed, had mercy, affections, salutations, on anyone from Your servants, \nوَ اَنْبِيَآئِكَ وَ رُسُلِكَ وَ صِفْوَتِكَ\nWA AMBEYAA-EKA WA ROSOLEKA WA SIFWATEKA \nYour prophets, Your messengers, Your chosen ones \nوَ اَهْلِ الْكَرَامَةِ عَلَيْكَ مِنْ خَلْقِكَ\nWA AHLIL KARAAMATE A’LAYKA MIN KHALQEKA. \nand the honoured ones from among Your creatures. \nاَللّٰهُمَّ وَ صَلِّ عَلٰى اَمِيْرِ الْمُؤْمِنِيْنَ\nALLAAHUMMA WA SALLE A’LAA A’LIYYIN AMEERIL MOA-MENEENA \nO Allah send blessings upon Ali, the Chief of the faithfuls, \nوَ وَصِىِّ رَسُوْلِ رَبِّ الْعٰالَمِيْنَ\nWA WASIYYE RASOOLE RABBIL A’ALAMEENA \nthe successor to the Messenger of the Lord of the universe, \nعَبْدِكَ وَ وَلِيِّكَ وَ اَخِى رَسُوْلِكَ وَ حُجَّتِكَ عَلٰى خَلْقِكَ\nA’BDEKA WA WALIYYEKA WA AKHEE RASOOLEKA WA HUJJATEKA A’LAA KHALQEKA \nYour servant, Your beloved representative, brother of Your Messenger and Your Proof upon Your creatures.\nوَ اٰيَتِكَ الْكُبْرٰى وَ النَّبَاِ الْعَظِيْمِ\nWA AAYATEKAL KUBRAA WAN-NABA-IL A’ZEEME \nYour greatest sign, Your important news. \nوَ صَلِّ عَلَى الصِّدِّيْقَةِ الطَّاهِرَةِ فَاطِمَةَ سَيِّدَةِ نِسَآءِ الْعٰالَمِيْنَ\nWA SALLE A’LAS SIDDEEQATIT TAAHERATE FAATEMATA SAYYEDATE NESAA-IL A’ALAMEENA \nAnd (O Allah) send blessings upon the truthful, the pure Fatemah, the leader of the women of the universe, \nوَ صَلِّ عَلٰى سِبْطَىِ الرَّحْمَةِ وَ اِمَامَىِ الْهُدٰى اَلْحَسَنِ وَ الْحُسَيْنِ\nWA SALLE A’LAA SIBTAYIR RAHMATE WA EMAAMAYIL HODAL HASANE WAL HUSAYNE \nand (O Allah) send blessing upon the two grandsons of the mercy, and the two Imams of guidance, Hasan and Husain, \nسَيِّدَىْ شَبَابِ اَهْلِ الْجَنَّةِ\nSAYYEDAY SHABAABE AHLIL JANNATE \nthe two leaders of the Youths of the Paradise \nوَ صَلِّ عَلٰى اَئِمَّةِ الْمُسْلِمِيْنَ عَلِىِّ بْنِ الْحُسَيْنِ\nWA SALLE A’LAA A-IMMATIL MUSLEMEENA A’LIYYIB NIL HUSAYNE \nand (O Allah) send blessings upon the Imams of Muslims, Ali the son of Husain,\nوَ مُحَمَّدِ بْنِ عَلِىٍّ وَ جَعْفَرِ بْنِ مُحَمَّدٍ\nWA MOHAMMAD IBNE A’LIYYIN WA JA’FAR IBNE MOHAMMADIN \nMohammad, the son of Ali, Ja’far, the son of Mohammad; \nوَ مُوْسٰى بْنِ جَعْفَرٍ وَ عَلِىِّ بْنِ مُوْسٰى\nWA MOOSABNE JA’FARIN WA A’LIYY IBNE MOOSAA \nMoosa, the son of Jafar; Ali, the son of Moosa; \nوَ مُحَمَّدِ بْنِ عَلِىٍّ و عَلِىِّ بْنِ مُحَمَّدٍ\nWA MOHAMMAD IBNE A’LIYYIN WA A’LIYY IBNE MOHAMMADIN \nMohammad, the son of Ali; Ali, the son of Mohammad; \nوَ الْحَسَنِ بْنِ عَلِىٍّ وَالْخَلَفِ الْهَادِى الْمَهْدِىِّ\nWAL HASAN IBNE A’LIYYIN WAL KHALAFIL HAADIL MAHDIYYE \nHasan, the son of Ali; and the successor, the Guide, Mahdi \nحُجَجِكَ عَلٰى عِبَادِكَ وَ اُمَنَآئِكَ فِىْ بِلاَدِكَ\nHOJAJEKA A’LAA E’BAADEKA WA OMANAA-EKA FEE BELAADEKA \nYour Proof upon Your servants and Your trustworthy one in Your cities. \nصَلٰوةً كَثِيْرَةً دَآئِمَةً\nSALAATAN KASEERATAN DAA-EMATAN. \nBlessings, Abundant and permanent. \nاَللّٰهُمَّ وَ صَلِّ عَلٰى وَلِىِّ اَمْرِكَ الْقَآئِمِ الْمُؤَمَّلِ\nALLAAHUMMA WA SALLE A’LAA WALIYYE AMREKAL QAA-EMIL MO-AMMALE\nO Allah and send blessings upon the master of Your command, the Qaem (Upright), the expected one \nوَ الْعَدْلِ الْمُنْتَظَرِ وَ حُفَّهٗ بِمَلَآئِكَتِكَ الْمُقَرَّبِيْنَ\nWAL-A’DLIL MUNTAZARE WA HUFFAHU BE-MALAA-EKATEKAL MOQARRABEENA \nand the awaited justice, surround him with Your prominent Angels \nوَ اَيِّدْهُ بِرُوْحِ الْقُدُسِ يَا رَبَّ الْعَالَمِيْنَ\nWA AYYIDHO BE-ROOHIL QODOSE YAA RABBAL A’ALAMEENA. \nand support him with ‘Ruh al-Qudus’ (the Holy Spirit), O Lord of the universe \nاَللّٰهُمَّ اجْعَلْهُ الدَّاعِىَ اِلٰى كِتَابِكَ\nALLAAHUMMAJ A’LHUD DAA-EYA ELAA KETAABEKA \nO Allah make him the caller to Your Book\nوَ الْقَآئِمَ بِدِيْنِكَ\nWAL QAA-EMA BE-DEENEKA \nand the Qaem (upright one) with Your religion, \nاسْتَخْلِفْهُ فِى الْاَرْضِ كَمَا اسْتَخْلَفْتَ الَّذِيْنَ مِنْ قَبْلِهٖ\nISTAKHLIFHO FIL ARZE KAMAS TAKHLAFTAL LAZEENA MIN QABLEHI\nappoint him in the earth, as You appointed Those before him. \nمَكِّنْ لَهٗ دِيْنَهُ الَّذِىْ ارْتَضَيْتَهٗ لَهٗ\nMAKKIN LAHU DEENAHUL LAZEER TAZAYTAHU LAHU \nGrant authority for him concerning his religion which You have chosen for him.\nاَبْدِلْهُ مِنْ بَعْدِ خَوْفِهٖ اَمْنًا\nABDILHO MIN BA’DE KHAWFEHI AMNAN \nConvert his fear into security \nيَعْبُدُكَ لَا يُشْرِكُ بِكَ شَيْئًا\nYA’BODOKA LAA YUSHREKO BEKA SHAY-AN. \nas He worships only You and does not associate anyone with You,\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اَعِزَّهُ وَ اَعْزِزْ بِهٖ وَ انْصُرْهُ وانْتَصِرْ بِهٖ\nALLAAHUMMA A-I’ZZAHU WA A-A’ZIZ BEHI WAN SURHO WAN TASIR BEHI \nO Allah strengthen him and strengthen (the believer) through him. \nوَانْصُرْهُ نَصْرًا عَزِيْزًا وَ افْتَحْ لَهٗ فَتْحًا يَسِيْرًا\nWAN SURHO NASRAN A’ZEEZAN WAF TAH LAHU FATHAN YASEERAN \nHelp him and help the believer through him, and help him a mighty helping and grant him an easy victory.\nوَ اجْعَلْ لَهٗ مِنْ لَدُنْكَ سُلْطَانًا نَصِيْرًا\nWAJ A’L LAHU MIN LADUNKA SULTAANAN NASEERAN. \nAnd make him from Your side the helped authority. \nاَللّٰهُمَّ اَظْهِرْ بِهٖ دِيْنَكَ وَ سُنَّتَ نَبِيِّكَ\nALLAAHUMMA AZHIR BEHI DEENAKA WA SUNNATA NABIYYEKA \nO Allah! Merit Your religion and the tradition of Your Prophet through him \nحَتّٰى لَا يَسْتَخْفِىَ بِشَىْءٍ مِنَ الْحَقِّ مَخَافَةَ اَحَدٍ مِنَ الْخَلْقِ\nHATTAA LAA YASTAKHFEYA BE-SHAY-IN MENAL HAQQE MAKHAAFATA AHADIN MENAL KHALQE. \ntill, nothing is hidden from the Truth due to fear of the creatures\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اِنَّا نَرْغَبُ اِلَيْكَ فِى دَوْلَةٍ كَرِيْمَةٍ\nALLAAHUMMA INNAA NARGHABO ELAYKA FEE DAWLATIN KAREEMATIN \nO Allah! We desire from You a noble Government \nتُعِزُّ بِهَا الْاِسْلاَمَ وَ اَهْلَهٗ وَ تُذِلُّ بِهَا النِّفَاقَ وَ اَهْلَهٗ\nTO-I’ZZO BEHAL ISLAAMA WA AHLAHU WA TOZILLO BEHAN NEFAA-QA WA AHLAHU \nthrough which You help Islam and its followers and degrade hypocrisy and its followers \nوَ تَجْعَلُنَا فِيْهَا مِنَ الدُّعَاةِ اِلٰى طَاعَتِكَ\nWA TAJ-A’LONAA FEEHAA MENAD DO-A’ATE ELAA TAA-A’TEKA \nand make us in (the government) among the callers to Your obedience \nوَالْقَادَةِ اِلٰى سَبِيْلِكَ وَ تَرْزُقُنَا بِهَا كَرَامَةَ الدُّنْيَا وَ الْآخِرَةِ\nWAL QAADATE ELAA SABEELEKA WA TARZOQONAA BEHAA KARAAMATAD DUNYAA WAL AAKHERATE. \nand guides to Your path and through it grant us the honour of this world and hereafter. \nاَللّٰهُمَّ مَا عَرَّفْتَنَا مِنَ الْحَقِّ فَحَمِّلْنَاهُ\nALLAAHUMMA MAA A’RRAFTANAA MENAL HAQQE FAHAMMILNAAHO \nO Allah whatever You have introduced to us from the truth then make us bear it \nوَ مَا قَصُرْنَا عَنْهُ فَبَلِّغْنَاهُ\nWA MAA QASURNAA A’NHO FA-BALLIGHNAAHO. \nand reach unto us what we have fallen short of (performing)\nاَللّٰهُمَّ الْمُمْ بِهٖ شَعْثَنَا\nALLAAHUMMAL MUM BEHI SHA’SANAA \nO Allah! Through him, congregate our dispersed ones, \nوَ اشْعَبْ بِهٖ صَدْعَنَا\nWASH-A’B BEHI SAD-A’NAA \nand collect our scattered ones, \nوَ ارْتُقْ بِهٖ فَتْقَنَا وَ كَثِّرْ بِهٖ قِلَّتَنَا\nWAR-TUQ BEHI FATQANAA WA KASSIR BEHI QILLATANAA \nand unite our disunited ones. Increase our scantiness through him, \nوَ اَعْزِزْ بِهٖ ذِلَّتَنَا وَ اَغْنِ بِهٖ عَائِلَنَا\nWA A-A’ZIZ BEHI ZILLATANAA WA AGHNE BEHI A’A-ELANAA\ngrant respect to our disgraced ones through him. Make our poor rich through him. \nوَ اقْضِ بِهٖ عَنْ مُغْرَمِنَا\nWAQ ZE BEHI A’N MUGHRAMENAA \nAnd pay our debts through him. \nوَ اجْبُرْ بِهٖ فَقْرَنَا وَ سُدَّ بِهٖ خَلَّتَنَا\nWAJ BUR BEHI FAQRANAA WA SUDDA BEHI KHALLATANAA\nRemove our poverty through him. Dispel our adversities through him. \nوَ يَسِّرْ بِهٖ عُسْرَنَا وَ بَيِّضْ بِهٖ وُجُوْهَنَا\nWA YASSIR BEHI U’SRANAA WA BAYYIZ BEHI WOJOOHANAA \nMake our difficulties easy through him. Brighten our faces through him. \nوَ فُكَّ بِهٖ اَسْرَنَا وَ اَنْجِحْ بِهٖ طَلِبَتَنَا\nWA FUKKA BEHI ASRANAA WA ANJEH BEHI TALEBATANAA \nMake us free from our prison through him. \nوَ انْجِزْ بِهٖ مَوَاعِيْدَنَا\nWA ANJIZ BEHI MAWAA-E’EDANAA \nComplete our demands through him. \nوَ اسْتَجِبْ بِهٖ دَعْوَتَنَا\nWAS TAJIB BEHI DA’WATANAA \nFulfill our promises through him.\nوَ اَعْطِنَا بِهٖ سُؤْلَنَا\nWA A-A’TENAA BEHI SO’LANAA \nAnswer our prayers through him.\nوَ بَلِّغْنَا بِهٖ مِنَ الدُّنْيَا وَ الْآخِرَةِ آمَالَنَا\nWA BALLIGHNAA BEHI MENAD DUNYAA WAL AAKHERATE AAMAALANAA \nGrant our requests through him and fulfill our hopes of this world and hereafter through him. \nوَ اَعْطِنَا بِهٖ فَوْقَ رَغْبَتِنَا\nWA A-A’TENAA BEHI FAWQA RAGHBATENAA \nAnd provide us more than our expectations. \nيَا خَيْرَ الْمَسْئُوْلِيْنَ\nYAA KHAYRAL MAS-OOLEENA \nO the Best of the asked one \nوَ اَوْسَعَ الْمُعْطِيْنَ اشْفِ بِهٖ صُدُوْرَنَا\nWA AWSA-A’L MO’TEENA ISHFE BEHI SODOORANAA \nand the Largest of Provider. Cure our hearts through him \nوَ اَذْهِبْ بِهٖ غَيْظَ قُلُوْبِنَا\nWA AZHIB BEHI GHAYZA QOLOOBENAA \nand remove the anger of our hearts through him.\nوَاهْدِنَا بِهٖ لِمَا اخْتُلِفَ فِيْهِ مِنَ الْحَقِّ بِاِذْنِكَ\nWAH DENAA BEHI LEMAKH TOLEFA FEEHE MENAL HAQQE BE-IZNEKA \nAnd guide us in dispute concerning the truth through him with Your permission. \nاِنَّكَ تَهْدِىْ مَنْ تَشَآءُ اِلٰى صِرَاطٍ مُسْتَقِيْمٍ\nINNAKA TAHDEE MAN TASHAA-O ELAA SERAATIL MUSTAQEEME \nYou guide to whomever You Wish to the right path. \nوَ انْصُرْنَا بِهٖ عَلٰى عَدُوِّكَ وَ عَدُوِّنَا\nWAN SURNAA BEHI A’LAA A’DUWWEKA WA A’DUWWENAA \nAnd help us through him against Your enemies and Our enemies,\nاِلٰهَ الْحَقِّ اٰمِيْنَ\nELAAHAL HAQQE AAMEENA. \nO Lord of Truths, Ameen. \nاَللّٰهُمَّ اِنَّا نَشْكُوْ اِلَيْكَ\nALLAAHUMMA INNAA NASH-KOO ELAYKA \nO Allah, we complain to You,\nفَقْدَ نَبِيِّنَا صَلَوٰاتُكَ عَلَيْهِ وَ آلِهٖ\nFAQDA NABIYYENAA SALAWAATOKA A’LAYHE WA AALEHI \nthe loss of our prophet, Your blessing be upon him and his progeny \nوَ غَيْبَةَ وَلِيِّنَا وَ كَثْرَةَ عَدُوِّنَا\nWA GHAYBATA WALIYYENAA WA KASRATA A’DUWWENAA \nand the occultation of our master, the proliferate of our enemies,\nوَ قِلَّةَ عَدَدِنَا وَشِدَّةَ الْفِتَنِ بِنَا\nWA QILLATA A’DADENAA WA SHIDDATAL FETANE BENAA \nthe scarcity of our numbers, the severity of mischief amongst us,\nوَ تَظْاهُرَ الزَّمَانِ عَلَيْنَا\nWA TAZAAHORAZ ZAMAANE A’LAYNAA \noppositions of the time against us. \nفَصَلِّ عَلٰى مُحَمَّدٍ وَ اٰلِهٖ\nFA-SALLE A’LAA MOHAMMADIN WA AALEHI \nSend blessings upon Mohammad and his progeny and help us\nوَ اَعِنَّا عَلٰى ذٰلِكَ بِفَتْحٍ مِنْكَ تُعَجِّلُهٗ\nWA A-I’NNA A’LAA ZAALEKA BE-FATHIN MINKA TO-A’JJELOHU \nin all these, with a hastened victory from Your side. \nوَ بِضُرٍّ تَكْشِفُهٗ وَ نَصْرٍ تُعِزُّهٗ\nWA BEZURRIN TAK-SHEFOHU WA NASRIN TO-I’ZZOHU \nAnd by the removal of difficulties and a mighty helping, \nوَ سُلْطَانِ حَقٍّ تُظْهِرُهٗ\nWA SULTAANE HAQQIN TUZHEROHU \nand a truthful king whom You manifest \nوَ رَحْمَةٍ مِنْكَ تُجَلِّلُنَاهَا\nWA RAHMATIN MINKA TO-JALLELONAAHAA \nand mercy from Your side which You make us respect\nوَ عَافِيَةٍ مِنْكَ تُلْبِسُنَاهَا \nWA A’AFEYATIN MINKA TULBESONAAHAA \nand cover us with Your safety \nبِرَحْمَتِكَ يَا اَرْحَمَ الرَّاحِمِيْنَ.\nBE-RAHMATEKA YAA ARHAMAR RAAHEMEENA.\nthrough Your Mercy, O the Most Merciful of mercifuls.",
  "merits": "The word Iftetah is used in the Urdu language and its literal meaning is “to start” or “to commence.” It is for this reason that [Surah Hamd](A5) is called “Fatehatul Kitab” or ‘the surah which starts the Quran”. Therefore our scholars recommend that after sighting the moon of the holy month of Ramazan, one should commence the recitation of the Quran with the recitation of [Surah Hamd](A5) and commence the sequence of supplications with this dua.\nDua-e-Iftetah is narrated by Shaikh Abbas Qummi in Mafatihul Jinaan from Hazrat Imam-e-Zamana (a.t.f.s.) and is amongst those duas which are recommended for recitation every night. In reality, a glance at the meanings of the words of this dua makes us feel that it is a rendition of our heartfelt entreaties. The characteristics found in those duas which are narrated by the Holy Imams (a.s.), are present in this dua as well, which is an added proof that this dua is narrated by Hazrat Imam-e-Zamana (a.t.f.s.) himself and not from an ordinary individual. These characteristics include:\n1.\tThe praise and glorification of Allah in the words of the Holy Imams (a.s.)\n2.\tAcknowledgement of the bounties of Allah and His covering of our sins\n3.\tSeeking forgiveness for our sins and requesting for bounties from Allah\n4.\tSeeking blessings and benedictions upon the Ahle Bayt (a.s.)\nDua-e-Iftetah, in addtion to the above features, encompasses these aspects:\nIt seeks salutations and blessing upon the Holy Imams (a.s.) in the nights of Mah-e-Ramazan. This act itself is the key for the acceptance of supplications. It is also the best way to seek the duas of the Imams (a.s.) for our needs.\nA special part of this dua is dedicated to supplications for Hazrat Imam Mahdi (a.s.) – supplication for his health and well being; supplication for his respect; supplication for our own safety and the protection of our respect for his sake as well as supplications for his early reappearance. It also seeks a pure and long government and wealth for him; the elevation of the flag of Islam and the end of all forms of polytheism and hypocrisy. In addition to this, the sentences of this dua seek help for repayment of debts, for expansion of sustenance and alleviation of all difficulties and worries.\nThe last part of the dua is expressed as a plea before Allah, the Almighty in which we convey our love for Ahle Bayt (a.s.) right from Holy Prophet (s.a.w.a.) up to Imam Mahdi (a.s.). In addition, the true meaning of Iftetah, which is victory or good start is shown to be the time of reappearance of Imam-e-Zamana (a.t.f.s.). These expressions of the dua are given below –\n“O Allah! We complain to You, the loss of our prophet, Your blessings be upon him and his progeny and the occulation of our master, the proliferate of our enemies, the scarcity of our numbers, the severity of mischief upon us, oppositions of the time against us. Send blessings upon Mohammed (s.a.w.a.) and his progeny. And help us in all these, with a hastened victory from Your side. And by the removal of difficulties and a mighty helping, and a truthful king whom You manifest and mercy from Your side which You make us respect and cover with Your safety through Your Mercy, O the Most Merciful of mercifuls.”\nTherefore, we request all believers that from the eve of the Holy month of Ramazan till its last night, one should not forsake the recitation of this dua for even a single night. In order that one receives an increased reward for this action, one should make an intention from the first night itself to recite this dua on behalf of Imam-e-Zamana (a.t.f.s.) and offer the reward of this recitation to Hazrat Zahra (s.a.). Inshallah, with this action, he will recieve the tawfeeq to recite the dua in the right spirit.",
